{"id": "34810", "title": "梦回大清", "author": "金子", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 96, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34810/34810s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34810.htm", "intro": "劫后重生的茗薇自主更名为兆佳氏·鱼宁，可是更换了名字是否就能改变命运呢？失却了十三福晋身份的她还会遭遇怎样的命运起伏？与四爷和十三爷的纠葛又会出现何样的结局？\r\n本书是作者已经出版的《梦回大清》的终结篇，描述了女主角小薇在陪伴十三阿哥高墙圈禁三年后面对“九王夺嫡”这一关键时期所发生的故事。\r\n 小说延续了第一部的风格，让读者如身临其境般地融入故事中，感受女主角的爱与痛、喜与悲……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34810", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章 三年", "file": "2257761.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2257762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 重逢·上", "file": "2257763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2257764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2257765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2257766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2257767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 重逢·下", "file": "2257768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2257769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2257770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2257771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章 自由", "file": "2257772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2257773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2257774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2257775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2257776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2257777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章 距离", "file": "2257778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2257779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2257780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2257781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章 宫门", "file": "2257782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2257783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2257784.html", "available": false}, {"tit